WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.600
Iva, the grocery agent that pays for her own brain.

2
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.800
Most AI agents die the day their owner stops paying the API bill.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.800
Iva earns her keep, and pays for her own thinking on 0G.

4
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:18.500
Send her a grocery list on Telegram, or open the website.

5
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:23.600
She checks Blinkit, Instamart and Zepto at your address.

6
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:30.500
A real hunt in Mumbai: 12 eggs, 1 kg onion, 1 litre milk.

7
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:37.500
Cheapest basket: Zepto ₹213 vs Instamart ₹288. You save ₹75.

8
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:45.500
Her brain runs on 0G, sealed in a TEE, and every call has a request ID and a cost.

9
00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:52.000
Behind one hunt: nine real steps in about 30 seconds.

10
00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:57.600
0G models read the list and match the same product across shops.

11
00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:04.500
The loop: you pay 0.2 0G a hunt into Iva's own wallet.

12
00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:10.500
She signs depositFor on the 0G Payment Layer herself. No human tops her up.

13
00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:19.400
She earns 0.2 0G a hunt and spends about 0.02 0G thinking.

14
00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:28.800
Proof on 0G mainnet: a customer pays Iva…

15
00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:39.400
…and seconds later Iva deposits into her own compute account, signed by her wallet.

16
00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:45.800
She reads her own balance before every job and picks the best brain she can afford.

17
00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:51.600
Spend cap of 2 0G a day, enforced by 0G. When money runs low she degrades, she doesn't crash.

18
00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:58.400
Arkiv is a public notice board where every note deletes itself on a timer.

19
00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:04.800
Every hunt pins its winning prices there, signed by Iva, set to expire in 6 hours.

20
00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:11.600
/deals reads them back: free, never stale, open to any app or agent.

21
00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:18.000
Say “order”: Iva fills your Zepto cart through Zepto's official MCP.

22
00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:23.600
Zepto's bill first, and nothing is ordered without your YES.

23
00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:35.600
Built for 0G Agents That Pay for Themselves, 0G Private Computer and Build on Arkiv.

24
00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:43.400
Live now: the bot, the website, and every transaction on-chain.

25
00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:50.200
Built by three humans and one very confident dog.

26
00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:56.600
Iva earns. Iva pays. Iva keeps working.
